  their  100644 5a3dcae4ddc210585c265aeb90c3931d547b4da4 docs/audits/wx-phase1b5-8-context-relevance/ARCHITECTURE.md
@@ -0,0 +1,15 @@
+# WX Phase 1B.5.8 — Architecture
+
+**Contract:** `wx-context-relevance-v1` · `1.0.0` · phase `1b.5.8`
+
+## Pipeline
+
+Registry → Presentation → Assist → Disclosure → Tool Action → Honesty Density → Contextual Priority → **Contextual Relevance**
+
+## Role
+
+Explains WHY already-authorized surfaces are relevant in the current Workspace context. Diagnostics metadata only.
+
+## Sealed non-effects
+
+No render · no layout · no ordering · no visibility · no activation · no ownership · no chrome · no feed · no change to Priority / Honesty / Tool / Disclosure / Assist / Presentation.
added in remote
